    {
      "text": "II. BAYESIAN FILTERING",
      "bbox": [
        121.31983947753906,
        348.8896179199219,
        227.75355529785156,
        362.1797790527344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Let us summarize the basic principles of Bayesian ﬁltering.",
      "bbox": [
        58.91984558105469,
        367.72943115234375,
        300.0908508300781,
        381.01959228515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Its goal is the estimation of the state variables of a discrete-",
