        48.96007537841797,
        379.6095275878906,
        300.07763671875,
        392.8996887207031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "time nonlinear system which is “excited” by a sequence of",
      "bbox": [
        48.96006774902344,
        391.6095275878906,
        300.0777587890625,
        404.8996887207031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "random vectors. It is assumed that nonlinear combinations of",
      "bbox": [
        48.96006774902344,
        403.4896240234375,
        300.07763671875,
        416.77978515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the state variables corrupted by noise are observed. We have",
      "bbox": [
        48.96006774902344,
        415.4896240234375,
        300.1037292480469,
        428.77978515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
